## Mutation policy

This file is **append-only**. NO se modifica ni borra. Si forward se agrega un V5 frozen, nuevo manifest `_freeze-manifests/v5-baseline.md5` (similar pattern). NO se sobreescribe v4.

Codified per Pattern 7 + Principle 4 (Sólido = filesystem ground truth, no memoria humana).
